    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mapandī ga higūlya kwīnjiwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho yashila pyī ī yenīyī, a Baisilaeli abo baalīho hoi a henaho būsambaalīla ū mu mizengo ya Yuda būja bakūgabelagūlaga a mawe ayo galamiagwa, nī ng'hīngī ja lī Ashela būjibbutagūla. Na a mapandī ga higūlya būgakenaagūla, nī myalīlo pyī īyo yalī ū mu Yuda nū mu Benjamini nī Efulaimu, nī Manase. A Baisilaeli aho bamala ū kūgakenaagūla a gose genaya, būshoka kū kaya jabo na kū malaale ga wingīji wabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Banhū kūfunya shakwinha mu būtogwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Hezekia ūbatūūla a bagabīji na a Balawī būlī bene mu magele gabo na milīmo yabo, a bagabīji magele gabo na a Balawī magele gabo; kūlwa kūfunya shitambò sha kūpemvwa na shakwinha sha kūlūmba, na kūkumīlīja, na kwīmba mīmbo ga kūgongoola ha mibita y'ipandī lya kwikala lya ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī sha kūfunyiwa būlī lūshikū dilū na mhīndī kūbiza shitambò sha kūpemvwa, ūfunya ū ntemi kūfuma mu shikolo shakwe wei ng'wenekīlī; nī shitambò sha kūpemvwa ha lūshikū lwa Sabato, ha shigukulu sha ng'weji mpya, na ha shigukulu īsho shihelilwe, gīt'ūmo handīkilwe mu shilagīlo sha ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbalagīja a bana Yelusalemu kūyūbinha a bagabīji na a Balawī ī migabo īyo baalī bahelelilwe, gīkī badūle kwifunya chiza ū kū nīmo gwa shilagīlo sha ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho shafunyiwa ī shilagīlo shenīsho, haho na haho a Baisilaeli būfunya mu wiza ng'holò a matwajo ga kwandya ga shilīwa shabo, divai mhya, maguta na būūkī; nī shingī ī sha kūfuma mu shose īsho baagesaga kūfuma mu malaale. Beenha shikolo shingī no, kūbiza shakwinha sha zaka yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli na a banhū ba Yuda abo bikalaga kū mizengo ya hanze nabo benha ī zaka ja kūfuma mu madaale gabo ga ng'ombe na ga ng'holo na mbūli, nī zaka ja shikolo ī shose īsho shalī shamala kwejiwa kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wabo; būshitūlīīla gūbiza ma shise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo gwenūyū aho balīgwandya ū kūgwīta yalī ng'weji gwa kadatū, būmala mu ng'weji gwa mpungatī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Hezekia na a batūmami bakwe aho biza, bahayūūgabona a mashise, būnkumīlīja SEEBA, būbalombela a banhū bakwe, a Baisilaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Hezekia ūbabūūja a bagabīji na a Balawī ī mihayo ya mashise ga shikolo genayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azalia ūyo walī ngabīji ntaale, na wa kūfuma mu shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Sadoki, ūshosha, “Kūfuma aho bandīgije a banhū ū kwenha ī shakwinha shabo ū mu hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA, tūlī na sha kūlya shingī sha kūtwigela na kūtinda ho; nguno ū SEEBA wabīīlūkīlile a banhū bakwe, nīyo īsho mulīshibona shenīshi sha būshiigo dūhū.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shakwinha kūlwa bagabīji na Balawī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Hezekia ūfunya shilagīlo gīkī ū mu hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA shibeejiwe moi chumba sha kūbīkīla shikolo; na ng'hana ū mhayo gwenūyo gwītwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū bandya nīyo na ng'holò īmò, ū kwenha ī shakwinha shabo, ī zaka nī shikolo īsho shalī shamala kwejiwa. Ū ng'wanukūji wa shikolo shenīho walī Konania, ūmò wa Balawī; Shimei ng'wana wa ng'wawe walī wa ha sīlīlī yakwe ū mu nīmo gwenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi Hezekia nū Azalia, ū ntaale wa hekalu ya ng'wa Mulungu, būbatūūla ba Yehieli, Azazia, Nahasi, Asaheli, Yelimoti, Yozabadi, Elieli, Isimakia, Mahati na Benania kūbiza balang'hani ha sīlīlī ya ng'wa Konania nū ng'wana wa ng'wawe ū Shimei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nang'hani wa ha mita gwa kīya walī Koole ng'witūnja o ng'wa Imuna ūmò wa Balawī, ū ng'wene walī winhwa nīmo gwa wanukūji wa shakwinha īsho banhū bamfunījaga Mulungu kūlwa būtogwa wabo, na kūshigaba ī shakwinha īsho shafunyiagwa kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA, nī shakwinha īsho shalī shamala kwejiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walī na bagunanhi bakwe ba Edeni, Miniamini, Yeshua, Shemaya, Amalia na Shekania; a banhū benaba bangunanhaga mu būshikanu hangī chiza no ū mu mizengo ya bagabīji. Ī shakwinha shenīsho bashigabaga ū kū bagabīji bichaabo mu būtūūsolanhya, kūlenganīla na magele gabo; babize bataale nūūlū bado. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babagabīlaga pye a bagoosha, kwandīja ba myaka idatū kūja kwigūlya; abo mina gabo gaalī ū mu kwihela kwa banhū abo bigeleelwilwe kwingīla mu hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA kūtūmama milīmo yabo ya būlī mbika būlī lūshikū, ī milīmo īyo baalī bahelelilwe kūlwa magele gabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būyūbagabīla na a bagabīji kūlondeela kwihela kwa shibyalīlwe shabo, ūmo shalī sholekegije; na a Balawī kwandīja ba myaka makūmi abīlī na kūja kwigūlya, nabo kūlenganīla nī milīmo īyo baalī bahelelilwe mu magele gabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a baana babo būtūūlwa ū ng'wisaabu lyenīlo, hamò na a bake babo na a bitūnja babo na a bashīke babo; nguno nabo baalī bashisha ng'holò ū mu kwilang'hana gīkī bikale beela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Banhū balebe būsong'wa mu mina gabo; būtūūlwa a ha nīmo gwa kūbagabīla a bagabīji, a banhū ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Alooni, abo kaya jabo jalī mu magūngūli ayo gaalī gīpīndije ī mizengo yabo, na a babo bikalaga kū mizengo yīngī, būlī ngosha ūpandīka ngabo gwakwe; na a Balawī a bose abo baalīmo ū mu kwihela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Hezekia akabīītīla gīko pye a hose ū mu Yuda, wīta yawiza na yabūtūngīlīja na ya koolecha būshikanu kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī nīmo ūyo wahayaga kūgwīta ū mu būtūmami wa mu hekalu ya ng'wa Mulungu, wamūjaga ū Mulungu wakwe; na watūmamaga mu ng'holò īmò. Na lūūlū walī na kwīlūkīlwa kwawiza no.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
